WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A task is open. Your mind wanders.
A sales page offers a twelve-minute shortcut.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Attention is complicated.
People can miss a stranger changing in front of them.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
An attention experiment is not
proof of a meditation product.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 describes twelve levels
and four listening styles per level.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That describes the files.
It doesn't prove an hour of benefit in twelve minutes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute practice.
Check the price and terms. Choose the product, not the promise.
